**Describe the bug**
The conditional_alerts transition can be used to send an alert when other reports have been received with the same form and clinic, however it doesn't always include the report that triggered the transition as one of the reports.

**To Reproduce**
Steps to reproduce the behavior:
1. Configure the transition (example config below)
2. Go to the Admin app > Message Test
3. Submit a message `P <patient_id> 5` from a valid phone number
4. View the report in the app and verify that the alert message is generated as expected
5. Submit a message `P <patient_id> 7`
6. View the new report and see that the message is still generated.

**Expected behavior**
The message should not be generated because the LMP is not 5.

**Screenshots**
![conditional-alerts](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2064938/57765619-ef2cdc00-7759-11e9-8b1f-a58afae82faa.png)

**Environment**
- Instance: localhost
